{"id":"chatcmpl-27da7a23-25e5-4a0c-a113-1a2a0d501c89","object":"chat.completion","created":1792711207,"model":"qwen3.8-flash-next-atlas","system_fingerprint":"fp_atlas","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"The user is asking for ten practical tips for reducing household energy use, each with a one-sentence reason. This is a straightforward informational request. I'll provide clear, actionable tips with concise explanations.\n","content":"# Ten Practical Tips for Reducing Household Energy Use\n\n1. **Switch to LED light bulbs** — They use up to 75% less energy than incandescent bulbs and last significantly longer.\n\n2. **Unplug electronics when not in use** — Devices in standby mode continue to draw \"phantom\" power that adds up over time.\n\n3. **Set your water heater to 120°F (49°C)** — This is hot enough for most household needs while reducing the energy required to maintain the temperature.\n\n4. **Use a programmable or smart thermostat** — It automatically reduces heating and cooling when you're asleep or away, cutting HVAC waste.\n\n5. **Wash clothes in cold water** — About 90% of a washing machine's energy goes toward heating water, so cold cycles save substantially.\n\n6. **Seal air leaks around doors and windows** — Drafts force your heating and cooling systems to work harder to maintain a comfortable temperature.\n\n7. **Run dishwashers and washing machines only with full loads** — This maximizes the energy and water used per cycle, reducing the total number of loads needed.\n\n8. **Clean or replace HVAC filters monthly** — Clogged filters restrict airflow, making your system consume more energy to circulate air.\n\n9. **Use ceiling fans"},"finish_reason":"length","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":4482,"completion_tokens":320,"total_tokens":4802,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":4480,"audio_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":40,"audio_tokens":0,"accepted_prediction_tokens":211,"rejected_prediction_tokens":0},"time_to_first_token_ms":165.681814,"response_token/s":34.301457837033624}}